{"id":"128a3cd6545693f6","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-decidability.md","title":"GL Decidability","display":"df-gl-decidability — GL Decidability","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-decidability","aliases":["89-df-gl-decidability"],"display":"df-gl-decidability — GL Decidability","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-theorem]]","[[89-df-decidable-set]]","[[89-df-modal-godel-code]]"],"revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-decidability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-decidability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-decidability — GL Decidability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c2a8f862c318be2c\" href=\"?note=c2a8f862c318be2c\" title=\"89-df-gl-theorem\">89-df-gl-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"824ea1d54ff527bd\" href=\"?note=824ea1d54ff527bd\" title=\"89-df-decidable-set\">89-df-decidable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ff66b5cf43748aff\" href=\"?note=ff66b5cf43748aff\" title=\"89-df-modal-godel-code\">89-df-modal-godel-code</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{T\\!h}_{G\\!L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathcal{T\\!h}_{G\\!L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> is the GL theorem set.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner=g_{\\Box}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner=g_{\\Box}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> is the modal coding from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ff66b5cf43748aff\" href=\"?note=ff66b5cf43748aff\" title=\"89-df-modal-godel-code\">89-df-modal-godel-code</a>; its image <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Code}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{Code}_{\\Box}\\)</span> is decidable and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}\\)</span> is total computable.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Decidable}(X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Decidable}(X)\\)</span> is the decidable-set predicate for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathbb{N}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathbb{N}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Decidable}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Decidable}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span> 是下述定义的 GL 定理编码集可判定性性质缩写，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 在此为系统下标。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}decidability}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Decidable}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathrm{Decidable}\n\\bigl(\\{\\ulcorner A\\urcorner\\mid A\\in\\mathcal{T\\!h}_{G\\!L}\\}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}decidability}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Decidable}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathrm{Decidable}\n\\bigl(\\{\\ulcorner A\\urcorner\\mid A\\in\\mathcal{T\\!h}_{G\\!L}\\}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这里只定义 GL 定理编码集的可判定性；其成立性由后续可判定性定理\n（例如基于有限反模型搜索）证明。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>此处固定的是模态句法编码；一阶上游的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Godel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Godel}_S\\)</span> 具有不同输入载体，不能直接作为该模态函数的同签名来源。也可统一换用具有可判定像和可计算解码的其他标准模态编码。</p>\n<p>仅给“可计算单射”会使后续可判定性定理缺条件：设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(K\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> 是无限、可枚举但不可判定的集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k_i\">\\(k_i\\)</span> 为其无重复有效枚举。将可判定句法族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_i=(p_i\\to p_i)\">\\(T_i=(p_i\\to p_i)\\)</span> 编为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2k_i+1\">\\(2k_i+1\\)</span>，其余公式按另一个标准单射编码成偶数，仍得到有效单射；但定理码集与奇数的交恰编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>，所以不可判定。本修订固定标准可解码的句法规约，保留原书的 GL 可判定结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"c2a8f862c318be2c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"824ea1d54ff527bd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-decidable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-godel-code","status":"resolved","id":"ff66b5cf43748aff","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-godel-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-godel-code","status":"resolved","id":"ff66b5cf43748aff","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner=g_{\\Box}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathbb N$ is the modal coding from [[89-df-modal-godel-code]]; its image $\\mathrm{Code}_{\\Box}$ is decidable and $\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}$ is total computable.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{T\\!h}_{G\\!L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner=g_{\\Box}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Code}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Decidable}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Decidable}_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}decidability}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Decidable}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathrm{Decidable}\n\\bigl(\\{\\ulcorner A\\urcorner\\mid A\\in\\mathcal{T\\!h}_{G\\!L}\\}\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Godel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"K\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"k_i","display":false},{"tex":"T_i=(p_i\\to p_i)","display":false},{"tex":"2k_i+1","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false}],"bytes":1977,"backlinks":[{"id":"09d08f3e4b6f7fbb","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Decidable}_{\\mathrm{GL}}$ is the decidability predicate for the\nGödel-coded GL theorem set, as defined in [[89-df-gl-decidability]]."},{"id":"1b619488086561ea","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Decidable}_{\\mathrm{GL}}$ is the predicate from\n[[89-df-gl-decidability]]."},{"id":"f0380129bd9e48f3","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-89","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"自然数输入的判定接口：[[89-df-modal-godel-code]] → [[89-df-gl-decidability]] → [[89-thm-gl-decidability]]。"}],"outgoing":["c2a8f862c318be2c","824ea1d54ff527bd","ff66b5cf43748aff"]}